==German==
===Etymology===
Old High German ''habēn'', akin to Old Saxon ''hebbian''.
===Verb===
'''haben'''

# to [[have]], to [[possess]]
# auxiliary verb used to form the [[perfect tense]]

====Related terms====
*[[Habe]]
*[[Habsucht]]
*[[Haben]]
*[[Habgier]]
*[[Habseligkeit]]
*[[habhaft]]

